                "description": "* WHAT...Snow. Total snow accumulations 4 to 12 inches.\n\n* WHERE...Broad Pass.\n\n* WHEN...Until 7 AM AKDT Sunday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...An early season snowfall is expected for Broad\nPass through Sunday morning. Steady snow this morning may mix with\nrain and taper off for a time this afternoon before changing back\nto all snow Saturday evening through Sunday morning. Snow totals\nwill be highly dependent on temperatures with daytime highs in the\nlower to mid 30s. 2 to 8 inches of snow is likely with the first\nround of snow this morning and another 2 to 4 inches with the\nsecond round later tonight into Sunday morning.",
